    "Matching floor/capsule observation stations establish no continuous route or sightline.",
    "Native floor and original instrument contacts establish geometry, not engineering capacity or alignment operation.",
    "The original solid bench had a signal-generator overhang and crossed the rear wall/handle envelope. Its declared fitted side leaf and rear edge resolve those boundaries without moving instruments or modifying the door.",
