    "The initial context classifier rejected 59 instrument-side endpoint contacts. Independent triangle diagnostics established separation on the same support plane; the classifier now admits only exact owners separated by that datum, using the unchanged 30 micrometre tolerance.",
    "Initial front/rear framing clipped feet. Final framing includes all feet; earlier images remain diagnostic.",
    "Instrument cases, valves and other shop furniture remain coarse. The white scope material and other optical/atlas mismatches remain open.",
    "Captures, wrapper receipts and inert reports promote no requirements. No human acceptance, whole-shop acceptance or V2 completion is claimed."
